              {% assign chc_step_headline = 'Clean enamel. Ready to rebuild.' %}
              {% capture chc_step_body %}<p>With the biofilm barrier removed, enamel surface is exposed and clean. Nano-hydroxyapatite from your CALQIX tablet can now bond directly to enamel micro-lesions. Remineralisation is a contact process, it requires a clean surface. This is why sequence matters: flush first, then rebuild.</p>{% endcapture %}
              {% assign chc_callout_text = 'This is the CALQIX clinical protocol. Step 01: FlowCore. Step 02: CALQIX nano-HA tablets.' %}
              {% assign chc_cta_label = 'Start the full protocol' %}
              {% assign chc_cta_link = '#product-form' %}
              {% assign chc_cta_style = 'navy' %}
              {% assign chc_annotation_type = 'pulse' %}
              {% assign chc_image_alt = 'FlowCore Clinical White standing upright, clean product shot' %}
          {% endcase %}
          <article
